export async function listConcurrentEvents(bookId:string,eventCardId:string):Promise<StoryEventTiming[]>{const pool=await getNewDesignPool(),timing=assertFound((await pool.query("SELECT * FROM new_design.story_event_timings WHERE book_id=$1 AND event_card_id=$2 AND status='active' AND lifecycle IN ('planned','occurred')",[bookId,eventCardId])).rows[0],"事件没有可参与并发查询的有效故事时间。"),ids=new Set<string>();if(timing.normalized_start!==null){const rows=await pool.query("SELECT event_card_id FROM new_design.story_event_timings WHERE book_id=$1 AND status='active' AND lifecycle IN ('planned','occurred') AND event_card_id<>$2 AND normalized_start IS NOT NULL AND COALESCE(normalized_end,normalized_start)>=$3 AND normalized_start<=COALESCE($4,$3)",[bookId,eventCardId,timing.normalized_start,timing.normalized_end]);for(const row of rows.rows)ids.add(String(row.event_card_id));}const explicit=await pool.query("SELECT source_event_card_id,target_event_card_id FROM new_design.story_event_relations WHERE book_id=$1 AND status='active' AND relation_type IN ('simultaneous','overlaps') AND (source_event_card_id=$2 OR target_event_card_id=$2)",[bookId,eventCardId]);for(const row of explicit.rows)ids.add(String(row.source_event_card_id)===eventCardId?String(row.target_event_card_id):String(row.source_event_card_id));if(!ids.size)return[];const rows=await pool.query("SELECT * FROM new_design.story_event_timings WHERE book_id=$1 AND event_card_id=ANY($2::uuid[]) AND status='active' AND lifecycle IN ('planned','occurred') ORDER BY normalized_start NULLS LAST,sequence",[bookId,[...ids]]);return rows.rows.map(mapTiming);}
export async function listCausalGraph(bookId:string,eventCardId:string,direction:"upstream"|"downstream",maxDepth=10):Promise<StoryEventRelation[]>{if(maxDepth<1||maxDepth>50)throw new NewDesignError("因果查询深度必须在 1 到 50 之间。",422);const relations=await listStoryEventRelations(bookId,"causal"),byFrom=new Map<string,StoryEventRelation[]>(),byTo=new Map<string,StoryEventRelation[]>();for(const relation of relations){const from=relation.relationType==="depends_on"?relation.targetEventCardId:relation.sourceEventCardId,to=relation.relationType==="depends_on"?relation.sourceEventCardId:relation.targetEventCardId;byFrom.set(from,[...(byFrom.get(from)??[]),relation]);byTo.set(to,[...(byTo.get(to)??[]),relation]);}const queue:[string,number][]=[[eventCardId,0]],seenEvents=new Set([eventCardId]),seenRelations=new Map<string,StoryEventRelation>();while(queue.length){const[current,depth]=queue.shift()!;if(depth>=maxDepth)continue;for(const relation of (direction==="downstream"?byFrom:byTo).get(current)??[]){seenRelations.set(relation.id,relation);const from=relation.relationType==="depends_on"?relation.targetEventCardId:relation.sourceEventCardId,to=relation.relationType==="depends_on"?relation.sourceEventCardId:relation.targetEventCardId,next=direction==="downstream"?to:from;if(!seenEvents.has(next)){seenEvents.add(next);queue.push([next,depth+1]);}}}return[...seenRelations.values()];}

export async function invalidateStoryTimelineForBodySwitch(client:PoolClient,chapterDocumentId:string,adoptedBodyVersionId:string):Promise<void>{
  const timings=await client.query("UPDATE new_design.story_event_timings timing SET status='stale' FROM new_design.story_time_proposal_versions version WHERE timing.proposal_version_id=version.id AND version.chapter_document_id=$1 AND version.body_version_id<>$2 AND timing.status='active' RETURNING timing.*",[chapterDocumentId,adoptedBodyVersionId]);
  for(const timing of timings.rows){await client.query("UPDATE new_design.story_time_proposals SET status='stale',revision=revision+1,updated_at=now() WHERE id=$1",[timing.proposal_id]);await client.query("INSERT INTO new_design.story_time_review_actions(id,proposal_id,proposal_version_id,action,actor,note) VALUES($1,$2,$3,'mark_stale','system',$4)",[randomUUID(),timing.proposal_id,timing.proposal_version_id,"章节采用了其他正文版本，原故事时间等待重新核对。"]);await client.query("DELETE FROM new_design.story_time_positions WHERE canonical_timing_id=$1",[timing.id]);}
  const pendingTimes=await client.query("UPDATE new_design.story_time_proposals proposal SET status='stale',revision=revision+1,updated_at=now() FROM new_design.story_time_proposal_versions version WHERE proposal.current_version_id=version.id AND version.chapter_document_id=$1 AND version.body_version_id<>$2 AND proposal.status='proposed' RETURNING proposal.id,proposal.current_version_id",[chapterDocumentId,adoptedBodyVersionId]);for(const row of pendingTimes.rows)await client.query("INSERT INTO new_design.story_time_review_actions(id,proposal_id,proposal_version_id,action,actor,note) VALUES($1,$2,$3,'mark_stale','system',$4)",[randomUUID(),row.id,row.current_version_id,"章节采用了其他正文版本，故事时间草案等待修改来源。"]);
  const relations=await client.query("UPDATE new_design.story_event_relations relation SET status='stale' FROM new_design.story_relation_proposal_versions version WHERE relation.proposal_version_id=version.id AND version.chapter_document_id=$1 AND version.body_version_id<>$2 AND relation.status='active' RETURNING relation.*",[chapterDocumentId,adoptedBodyVersionId]);for(const relation of relations.rows){await client.query("UPDATE new_design.story_relation_proposals SET status='stale',revision=revision+1,updated_at=now() WHERE id=$1",[relation.proposal_id]);await client.query("INSERT INTO new_design.story_relation_review_actions(id,proposal_id,proposal_version_id,action,actor,note) VALUES($1,$2,$3,'mark_stale','system',$4)",[randomUUID(),relation.proposal_id,relation.proposal_version_id,"章节采用了其他正文版本，原事件关系等待重新核对。"]);}
  const pendingRelations=await client.query("UPDATE new_design.story_relation_proposals proposal SET status='stale',revision=revision+1,updated_at=now() FROM new_design.story_relation_proposal_versions version WHERE proposal.current_version_id=version.id AND version.chapter_document_id=$1 AND version.body_version_id<>$2 AND proposal.status='proposed' RETURNING proposal.id,proposal.current_version_id",[chapterDocumentId,adoptedBodyVersionId]);for(const row of pendingRelations.rows)await client.query("INSERT INTO new_design.story_relation_review_actions(id,proposal_id,proposal_version_id,action,actor,note) VALUES($1,$2,$3,'mark_stale','system',$4)",[randomUUID(),row.id,row.current_version_id,"章节采用了其他正文版本，事件关系草案等待修改来源。"]);
  await client.query("UPDATE new_design.story_event_narrative_occurrences SET status='stale',revision=revision+1,updated_at=now() WHERE chapter_document_id=$1 AND body_version_id<>$2 AND status='active'",[chapterDocumentId,adoptedBodyVersionId]);
}
